{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">\ud83d\udfe3 About This Game</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Embark on an addictive physics-based adventure through a world that's as sweet as it is treacherous!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Lick &amp; Roll</strong> is a physics-driven puzzle adventure game inspired by classic marble-rolling titles, wrapped in a delightful macaron-themed aesthetic. Take control of a colorful candy ball and conquer floating dessert tracks by spinning, bouncing, and rolling your way to the goal.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Each level is a miniature world of its own\u2014deceptively cute but full of tricky surprises. Keep your cool and master precise control as you navigate past tasty traps and perilous gaps, all to find the perfect path to victory.<br><br>\ud83c\udfae <strong>Jump into the sweet challenge!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This demo offers a tasty preview of <i>Lick &amp; Roll</i> \u2014 a relaxing yet thrilling physics puzzle game full of vibrant candy roads and daring twists. Experience a handful of handcrafted levels that test your precision, timing, and creativity. Perfect for a quick escape or a cozy challenge. Are you ready to roll?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3719930/extras/GIF_Rush.gif?t=1746718327\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3719930?t=1746718327","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3719930/52519d844f8f30bf34aaad0dea34044ba1b11b9f/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1746718327","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3719930/20523c21008530dec2ed666d3c8fa4d41cf461f6/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1746718327","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akama